cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite this repository and the associated thesis or publication when available."
title: "Noise-Robust Hybrid Quantum Neural Networks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gil"
    given-names: "Jesús"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeragilo/noise-robust-hqnn-framework"
abstract: >-
  Research software for evaluating and improving hybrid quantum-classical
  neural networks under simulated NISQ noise, including learned readout,
  multi-observable features, architecture search, noise-aware objectives,
  repeated trials, and robustness metrics.
keywords:
  - quantum machine learning
  - hybrid quantum neural networks
  - NISQ
  - quantum noise
  - robustness
  - Qiskit
  - PennyLane
  - Cirq
